OL,3,GNEWSAWoman arrested after 'suspicious'
OL,4,Ababy death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicicion of murder after the death
OL,8,Fof a baby girl, police have said.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled at about 07:40 BST on Saturday
OL,12,Fby the ambulance service with a "report
OL,13,Fof concern" for a woman and baby girl
OL,14,Fat a property in Oxford Way, Cambourne.
OL,16,FBoth were taken to Addenbrooke's
OL,17,FHospital in Cambridge but the baby was
OL,18,Fdeclared dead shortly after arrival.
OL,20,FThe woman remains in hospital, police
OL,21,Fsaid.
